{"id":"d3afa2f89c56aec1","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-ground-model-universe.md","title":"Ground Model Universe","display":"thm-ground-model-universe — Ground Model Universe","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ground-model-universe","aliases":["58-thm-ground-model-universe"],"display":"thm-ground-model-universe — Ground Model Universe","depends_on":["[[58-df-ground]]","[[58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ground-model-universe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ground-model-universe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-model-universe — Ground Model Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"58-df-ground\">58-df-ground</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension\">58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\">\\(V,W\\)</span> (universe and ground class parameters) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,G\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span> (ground-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"58-df-ground\">58-df-ground</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> (set-forcing-extension predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-model-universe}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\\exists\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,\\mathbb P,G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-model-universe}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\\exists\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,\\mathbb P,G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersection of all grounds is called the mantle; it need not equal the universe.</li>\n<li>There may be proper class many grounds.</li>\n<li>The conclusion reuses the registered extension predicate instead of feeding the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> to the set-coded generic-filter predicate or using an undeclared term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W[G]\">\\(W[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ground","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ground]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ground","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$ (ground-model predicate, see [[58-df-ground]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-model-universe}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\\exists\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(V,W,\\mathbb P,G).","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W[G]","display":false}],"bytes":1114,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-ground-model-universe.md|58-thm-ground-model-universe]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e","1de28866aa4ef668"]}